| info = *Chroma expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''50''' [[Energy]] to shed his outer pelt, imbued with elemental energy while sprouting wings and converting it into a stationary floating sentry with {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''1000 / 2000 / 4000 / 8000''' [[health]] and '''<u>200</u>''' [[armor]]. The sentry will attack all enemies within '''<u>20</u>''' meters with a continuous stream of elemental energy, dealing {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''100 / 200 / 300 / 400''' {{D|Heat}}, {{D|Electricity}}, {{D|Toxin}}, or {{D|Cold}} damage per tick with a '''<u>?%</u>''' status chance at '''<u>5</u>''' ticks per second.
**Damage type is based on Chroma's current elemental alignment, determined by Chroma's primary emission color or the selected element of {{A|Spectral Scream}}.
**The sentry is counted as a summon and is affected by {{M|Summoner's Wrath}}, {{Arcane|Arcane Camisado}}, and {{Arcane|Theorem Infection}}.
**Effigy drains {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}{{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''10''' energy per second while active and will remain active until Chroma's energy is depleted, the sentry's health is depleted, or the ability is deactivated by pressing the ability key again.
***Chroma '''cannot''' gain energy from {{A|Energy Vampire}}, {{A|Rally Point}}, [[Rift Plane]]'s innate energy regeneration, [[Squad Energy Restore]]s, {{M|Energy Siphon}}, {{M|Energy Nexus}}, {{M|Dreamer's Bond}}, and/or {{Focus|Wellspring}} while Effigy is active.
***[[Energy Orb]]s, [[Orokin Void]] [[Orokin Tower#Death Orbs|Death Orb]]'s energy restores, {{M|Rage}}, {{M|Hunter Adrenaline}}, {{M|Spellbound Harvest}}, {{Arcane|Arcane Energize}}, and {{Arcane|Emergence Dissipate}}'s Energy Motes can still replenish Chroma's energy while Effigy is active.
*The sentry has two separate abilities it can use.
**'''Scream:''' The sentry screams, stunning all enemies within '''<u>30</u>''' meters.
***'''15''' second cooldown.
**'''Wing Flap:''' The sentry will flap its wings and unleash a '''5''' meter AoE that deals '''<u>200</u>''' {{D|Heat}}, {{D|Electricity}}, {{D|Toxin}}, or {{D|Cold}} damage and {{D|Ragdoll|Ragdolls}} enemies.
***Damage type is based on Chroma's current elemental alignment, determined by Chroma's primary emission color or the selected element of {{A|Spectral Scream}}.
***The sentry will only use Wing Flap if there is an enemy within '''<u>5</u>''' meters of it.
***'''5''' second cooldown.
*Enemies killed by the sentry have a '''<u>15% / 30% / 45% / 60%</u>''' chance to drop additional [[credits]]. In addition, all credits that are picked up within '''<u>10</u>''' meters of the sentry yield '''<u>25% / 50% / 75% / 100%</u>''' additional credits.
**As credits are shared with the squad on pickup, a player only needs to be within range of Effigy to receive the additional credits, regardless of where the credits originally dropped.
**For enemies killed by the sentry within the percentage credit bonus range, credit income is increased by an average of '''<u>43.75% / 95% / 153.75% / 220%</u>'''. This ''assumes'' the credit chance on kill results in double credits from that enemy.
*While Effigy is active, Chroma can fight in his lightened form, gaining '''<u>20%</u>''' [[Movement Speed]] but with a '''<u>50%</u>''' armor reduction.
**The armor reduction is a ''multiplicative'' penalty that's applied to Chroma's total armor (e.g., with a maxed {{M|Steel Fiber}} and {{M|Intensify}}, Chroma with {{A|Vex Armor}} at full capacity will have his armor lowered to {{Math|350 {{mul}} (1 + 1.1 + 3.5 {{mul}} 1.3) {{mul}} 0.5|mt=y}} when Effigy is activated).
*When deactivated, Chroma can teleport his pelt from anywhere onto himself. This will stop movement and interrupt any action Chroma is doing, such as reloading, leaving a player vulnerable.
**When deactivated while sliding, Chroma's pelt will be reapplied to him without triggering the animation, even if the player immediately cancels his slide.
*Both the initial cast and the return of Chroma's pelt will cease any actions as they are a two-handed ability.
| interactions = 
* Effigy's damage per tick and knockback damage can be boosted by the '''Fury''' aspect of {{A|Vex Armor}}, while its armor can be increased by the '''Scorn''' aspect.
** Effigy will only maintain the damage and armor increase from {{A|Vex Armor}} so long as Chroma's Effigy is within range of it. 
